<title>MEXICO: Mexico's TIIE 28-day rate rises to 32.00 pct.</title>
<headline>Mexico's TIIE 28-day rate rises to 32.00 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mexico's 28-day interbank interest rate rose by 7.50 basis points to 32.00 percent on Thursday, from 31.9250 percent on Tuesday, Banco de Mexico said.  Mexican financial markets were closed on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The TIIE is a market-weighted average interbank rate that is revised daily.</p>
<p>-- Mexico City newsroom 525 7289558</p>
</text>
